  25:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h ****  *           one channel.
  26:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h ****  *  @note    Sharing data lines to multiple muxes _is_ possible, but
  27:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h ****  *           each channel sharing data lines must be set to the maximum
  28:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h ****  *           number of channels, even if some multiplexers have fewer
  29:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h ****  *           inputs connected.
  30:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/adc.h **** */
