1726:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \brief   Mask and shift a bit field value for use in a register bit range.
1727:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \param[in] field  Name of the register bit field.
