  51:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/dac.h **** 
  52:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/dac.h ****     /** Sets the number of bits per sample transmitted out of the DAC.
  53:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/dac.h ****      ** The output range will be: 0V - VDDA
